   2: 
   3: Domain-neutral client-pool, pending-message queue, prune, and broadcast
   4: mechanics. Each extension provider constructs one hub with its frozen route
   5: path (``/ws/storyboard-gemini-image-grabber``, ``/ws/animator-grok-video-grabber``)
